=== SUMMARY ===
data sources : RbacMatrixPageViewModel binds the shared S8 RbacMatrixStore via asRbacMatrixSource(); data:StateFlow<RbacDataState> (cache-then-network UiState<RbacMatrixSession> + open-mode + load-error code) and interaction:StateFlow<RbacInteractionState> (editing/draft/saving/dirtyCount/submitError). save() PUTs only diffMatrices(snapshot, draft) off the UI thread; the store refreshes the feed on success. No HTTP in the view.
nav          : web (unrouted) -> native composable("RbacMatrixPage") in TeslaSyncNavHost resolved via PageHosts (RbacMatrixPageHost.register at app start). Destinations.kt untouched (137 web-canonical pages invariant preserved; DestinationsTest green).
states       : loading (Spinner) / open-mode (GlassPanel1) / hard-error (AlertBanner + Retry) / empty (EmptyState) / content (GlassPanel2 + GlassPanel3). Read cells show a ✓/– mark (semantics allowed/denied); edit mode flips every cell to a Checkbox (semantics "Toggle role/perm"); Save shows "Save (N)" / "Saving…" and is disabled at 0 dirty cells; a save failure renders an inline danger AlertBanner. No region is ever blank (ADR-011).
a11y/theme   : per-cell + pill + loading content descriptions (Modifier.semantics); Checkbox/Buttons carry the Material >=48dp touch target; every color via MaterialTheme.colorScheme / TeslaTokens.status (dark + dynamic theme, ADR-005/ADR-015). Compose-native only — no webview.
diagnostics  : page records the one-shot PII-safe view.opened (surface="RbacMatrixPage", P1/S11) via RbacMatrixPageViewModel.recordViewOpened(); save outcomes log rbacMatrix.saved / rbacMatrix.saveFailed with no matrix content.
